  // snd.part           T2 template: every chapter's opener ("The Sounders' Song · Part n of 8" + the chapter title).
  // snd.stones_sing    T3 intro (introCutscene): the first rune stone sang — circling the player, notes in the air.
  // snd.shrine_answers T3: the Singing Shrine (or the ring) answered the repeat puzzle (s2.1 / s2.1a).
  // snd.decoded        T1: the first Song Disc decoded (s3.2).
  // snd.blueprint      T1: the alien blueprints appear (s4.1).
  // snd.chamber        T1: the first sound chamber (s4.4).
  // snd.first_echo     T3: the first Echo shows itself (played by the server when Elora first appears).
  // snd.great_song     T3, flashback: after Kamo and Feya — what the Great Song was (s5.2).
  // snd.song_of_return T3: the chart rings Ornemis once the Song of Return is played (s6.2 / s6.2a).
  // snd.arrival        T3: the ship enters Ornemis (s7.1). snd.landing T3: first landing on Soaniri (s7.2).
  // snd.elder          T3: the Eldest's request (s7.3). snd.choir_tower T3: the Young Voices begin (server, on approach).
  // snd.bridge_song    T4: the Bridge Song — the Qualis grow calm, the Echoes thank, the Eldest hears her people (s8.2).
  // snd.soundi_joins   T3: the Soundi chooses the player (s8.4). snd.epilogue T2 + credits, closes chapter 8.
